{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20267XmEqyKBH21795820985.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>歐洲廉航Norse Atlantic申請破產，理由是燃油成本飆升持續打擊營運。</p><p></p><p>Norse Atlantic母公司宣布，挪威營運部門正式宣告破產，因伊朗戰事導致油價飆升。公司行政總裁羅爾德表示，已為尋求解決方案盡了最大努力，申請破產是艱難的決定，並為乘客、員工及合作夥伴，所帶來的影響深表歉意。</p><p></p><p>公司成立於2021年3月，主要提供往來歐洲、北美、非洲，及亞洲的長途飛行服務。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T00:04:17.471106+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":187,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T23:07:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T16:34:57.457373+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T23:57:35.485214+00:00","content_hash":"c857a9c35d7e958f858713c3fb6e86721f1d0d63b424d1ab09afb76e0a55c413","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-28T00:04:17.471106+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}